# Durability policy — see DATA_PERSISTENCE.md
#
# Everything under data/, every results_*.csv, every top30_*.csv,
# and signals_history.csv is COMMITTED to git. The sandbox is
# ephemeral; only the git remote is durable. Hours of rate-limited
# yfinance / Investegate fetching live in those files. They must
# survive sandbox resets.
#
# Only ignore truly regenerable Python build artefacts:

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# Ephemeral system locations only (not anything under repo data/)
# We do NOT ignore /tmp/ within the repo; the /tmp/ directory is
# outside the repo so this entry was a no-op anyway.
